    "misc.guide.step1_title": "1. Learn the controls",
    "misc.guide.step1_text": "On PC, use WASD to walk, mouse to look, and click to act; R or scroll wheel rotates an item. To place, press G/Q or right-click, aim, and click to confirm; Esc cancels. On mobile, use the joystick, drag the screen to look, tap 📦 to choose a spot, and tap the world to confirm.",
    "misc.guide.step2_title": "2. Follow the aiming hints",
    "misc.guide.step2_text": "Approach an object and aim at it. The on-screen message shows what the current tool can do. On mobile, the action button follows the target; if nothing is compatible, the hint explains the next step.",
    "misc.guide.step3_title": "3. Prepare the container",
    "misc.guide.step3_text": "Use substrate to fill a bag or prepare PP5 with cornmeal and water. Each container shows what is missing. Avoid trying to inoculate an empty or unhydrated container.",
    "misc.guide.step4_title": "4. Seal and sterilize",
    "misc.guide.step4_text": "Before sterilization, use the Heat Sealer on a filled bag. Place the container in the pressure cooker, close the lid, and use the proper mode and heat. Wait until the status shows it is sterile.",
    "misc.guide.step5_title": "5. Inoculate carefully",
    "misc.guide.step5_text": "Sanitize the area, turn on the laminar flow hood, and use a compatible syringe or scalpel on a sterilized container. Watch the item label to see if it is colonizing, contaminated, or ready.",
    "misc.guide.empty_items": "The item list appears once the laboratory finishes loading.",
